#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:1
msgid "Serving a Model from an HPC Cluster"
msgstr "在 HPC 集群上提供模型服务"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:3
msgid ""
"Many self-hosters have GPUs, but not GPUs they own outright: the hardware"
" sits behind a batch scheduler (Slurm, PBS, LSF) that hands out a compute"
" node for a few hours at a time. This page covers running an OpenAI-"
"compatible model server on such a node and attaching it to the gateway."
msgstr ""
"很多自建用户有 GPU 可用，但这些 GPU "
"并不归自己所有：硬件由批处理调度器（Slurm、PBS、LSF）统一管理，每次分给你一个计算节点，只能用几个小时。本页介绍如何在这种节点上运行 "
"OpenAI 兼容的模型服务器，并把它接入网关。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:8
msgid ""
"Three things make this different from the fixed-host case in [Adding a "
"New Local Model](add-local-model.md):"
msgstr "和[添加新的本地模型](add-local-model.md)里的固定主机相比，这种情况有三点不同："

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:11
msgid ""
"**the node is ephemeral.** You get a different hostname on every "
"allocation, and the job ends whether or not you are finished with it;"
msgstr "**节点是临时的**。每次分配到的主机名都不一样，而且不管你用完没用完，作业都会结束；"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:13
msgid ""
"**the node is usually not routable** from wherever the gateway runs, and "
"often cannot reach a container registry either;"
msgstr "**网关所在的机器通常访问不到这个节点**，而且节点往往也连不上容器镜像仓库；"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:15
msgid ""
"**the allocation costs someone money or queue priority** for as long as "
"you hold it, so releasing it cleanly is part of the procedure, not an "
"afterthought."
msgstr "**只要你还占着这次分配，就一直有人在为它付钱或消耗排队优先级**，所以干净地释放它是流程的一部分，而不是事后才想起来的收尾。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:18
msgid ""
"The shape that follows from this: the model server binds loopback on the "
"compute node, an SSH reverse tunnel carries it to a **fixed** loopback "
"port on the gateway host, and the gateway's route names that fixed port. "
"The node's changing hostname then never appears in the model registry, "
"and a new allocation is picked up by restarting the tunnel rather than by"
" editing config."
msgstr ""
"所以做法是：模型服务器在计算节点上只绑定 loopback，用一条 SSH 反向隧道把它接到网关主机上一个**固定的** loopback "
"端口，网关的路由指向这个固定端口。这样，不断变化的节点主机名不会出现在模型注册表里；换了新的分配，只要重启隧道，不用改配置。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:34
msgid ""
"Every scheduler flag, path and port below is a placeholder. Cluster "
"policy — partition names, GPU resource names, walltime limits, which "
"container runtime is installed — is site-specific, and there is no "
"portable default."
msgstr ""
"下面所有的调度器参数、路径和端口都是占位符。集群策略——分区名、GPU 资源名、walltime "
"上限、装的是哪种容器运行时——每个集群都不一样，没有通用的默认值。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:38
msgid "1. Allocate a node"
msgstr "1\\. 申请一个节点"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:40
msgid ""
"With Slurm, an interactive allocation looks like this. Fill in the "
"placeholders from your site's documentation:"
msgstr "用 Slurm 申请交互式节点大致如下，占位符按你们集群的文档填写："

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:52
msgid ""
"Many sites also ship a local wrapper around this; use whichever your "
"documentation names. Note the job ID and the allocated node name — you "
"need the first to release the allocation and the second to log in:"
msgstr "很多集群还在这之上封装了自己的命令，以你们文档里写的为准。记下作业 ID 和分配到的节点名——前者用来释放这次分配，后者用来登录："

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:61
msgid ""
"The node name changes on every allocation. Do not put it in the model "
"registry."
msgstr "节点名每次分配都会变。不要把它写进模型注册表。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:63
msgid "2. Make the container image available offline"
msgstr "2\\. 让容器镜像可以离线取用"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:65
msgid ""
"Compute nodes frequently have no outbound network, so pulling the serving"
" image on the node fails. Pull it once somewhere that does have network, "
"export it to shared storage that the compute nodes can read, and import "
"it there."
msgstr "计算节点通常不能访问外网，在节点上直接拉取服务镜像会失败。应该先在能联网的机器上拉取一次，导出到计算节点能读到的共享存储，再在节点上导入。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:69
msgid ""
"Pin an exact tag (or a digest) rather than `:latest`. `:latest` means a "
"different image every time you export, which turns \"it worked last "
"week\" into an unreproducible report."
msgstr ""
"要固定一个确切的 tag（或 digest），不要用 `:latest`。`:latest` "
"每次导出都可能是不同的镜像，「上周还好好的」就成了没法复现的问题。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:84
msgid ""
"`docker save` / `docker load` take the same arguments if that is the "
"runtime your site provides."
msgstr "如果集群提供的运行时是 Docker，`docker save` / `docker load` 的参数完全一样。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:87
msgid "3. Start the model server"
msgstr "3\\. 启动模型服务器"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:105
msgid "Points worth understanding rather than copying:"
msgstr "下面几点要理解，不要照抄："

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:107
msgid ""
"**`--publish 127.0.0.1:8000:8000`** keeps the server off the cluster's "
"internal network. A bare `-p 8000:8000` publishes on every interface of "
"the node, with no authentication in front of it — and the node's cluster-"
"internal interfaces are reachable from every other machine on the fabric,"
" whether or not the allocation gives you the node exclusively. The "
"reverse tunnel in the next step is all the reachability you need."
msgstr ""
"**`--publish 127.0.0.1:8000:8000`** 让服务器不暴露在集群内网上。只写 `-p 8000:8000` "
"会把端口发布到节点的所有网卡上，前面没有任何鉴权——而集群内网上的其他机器都能访问节点的内网接口，不管这次分配是否让你独占这个节点。下一步的反向隧道已经足够让网关访问到它。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:113
msgid ""
"**`--host 0.0.0.0`** is the *container's* interface, not the node's. The "
"process must listen on the container's external interface for the "
"loopback publish above to reach it; binding `127.0.0.1` inside the "
"container would make the published port answer nothing."
msgstr ""
"**`--host 0.0.0.0`** 指的是*容器*的接口，不是节点的。进程必须监听容器的对外接口，上面那条只发布到 loopback "
"的端口映射才能把请求送进来；如果在容器内绑定 `127.0.0.1`，发布出去的端口不会有任何响应。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:117
msgid ""
"**`--tensor-parallel-size`** must match the number of GPUs visible in the"
" allocation. Two GPUs, `2`. Requesting more shards than GPUs fails at "
"startup."
msgstr ""
"**`--tensor-parallel-size`** 必须与本次分配中可见的 GPU 数量一致。两块 GPU 就写 `2`。要求的分片数多于 "
"GPU 数会在启动时失败。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:119
msgid ""
"**`--ipc=host`** gives vLLM's tensor-parallel worker processes the host's"
" shared-memory segment; the container default is too small for them. Set "
"a large `--shm-size` instead if your site disallows `--ipc=host`."
msgstr ""
"**`--ipc=host`** 把宿主机的共享内存段交给 vLLM 的张量并行 worker "
"进程使用；容器默认的共享内存太小，不够它们用。如果集群不允许 `--ipc=host`，就改为设置一个较大的 `--shm-size`。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:122
msgid ""
"**`--device nvidia.com/gpu=all`** is Podman's CDI syntax. Docker uses "
"`--gpus all`."
msgstr "**`--device nvidia.com/gpu=all`** 是 Podman 的 CDI 写法。Docker 用 `--gpus all`。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:124
msgid ""
"**`:Z`** on the volume relabels the mount for SELinux and is "
"Podman/Docker specific; drop it where SELinux is not enforced."
msgstr ""
"**`:Z`** 加在卷上，用于给挂载重新打 SELinux 标签，是 Podman/Docker 特有的写法；没有启用 SELinux "
"的机器上去掉它。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:126
msgid ""
"**`--served-model-name`** gives the model a stable short id. Without it "
"the served id is the filesystem path from `--model`, which is what the "
"gateway would then have to send as `provider_model_id`."
msgstr ""
"**`--served-model-name`** 给模型一个稳定的短 id。不加它的话，对外提供的 id 就是 `--model` "
"里那个文件系统路径，网关随后就得把这个路径作为 `provider_model_id` 发出去。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:130
msgid "Confirm on the node before going further:"
msgstr "继续之前，先在节点上确认："

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:136
msgid "4. Tunnel it to the gateway host"
msgstr "4\\. 用隧道接到网关主机"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:138
msgid ""
"From the compute node, open a reverse tunnel to a fixed loopback port on "
"the gateway host. Record the PID so you can close it later:"
msgstr "从计算节点开一条反向隧道，连到网关主机上一个固定的 loopback 端口。记下 PID，以便之后关闭："

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:155
msgid ""
"**Bind the remote end to `127.0.0.1`.** `-R 0.0.0.0:8001:...` asks the "
"gateway host to publish an unauthenticated model server to every network "
"it is on. It also only works if the gateway's `sshd` sets `GatewayPorts "
"yes`; leaving that off is the safer configuration."
msgstr ""
"**远端要绑定到 `127.0.0.1`**。`-R 0.0.0.0:8001:...` "
"等于要求网关主机把一个没有鉴权的模型服务器发布到它所在的每个网络上。而且只有网关主机的 `sshd` 设了 `GatewayPorts yes` "
"才会生效；保持这个选项关闭更安全。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:159
msgid ""
"**`ExitOnForwardFailure=yes`** makes the tunnel fail loudly when port "
"8001 on the gateway host is still held by a previous allocation's "
"forwarding, instead of connecting and quietly forwarding nothing. When "
"that happens, the thing holding the port is the *previous* allocation's "
"`ssh`, which lives on the **gateway host**, not on your current node — "
"your local PID file is useless for it. Clear it there:"
msgstr ""
"**`ExitOnForwardFailure=yes`** 的作用是：如果网关主机的 8001 "
"端口还被上一次分配的转发占着，隧道会直接报错退出，而不是连上后悄悄什么都不转发。出现这种情况时，占着端口的是*上一次*分配留下的 "
"`ssh`，它在**网关主机**上，不在你当前的节点上——你本地的 PID 文件管不到它。要到网关主机上清掉它："

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:171
msgid ""
"The tunnel dies with the allocation. To ride out network blips, wrap the "
"same command in `autossh`, a systemd user unit, or a shell retry loop — "
"but nothing will survive the job ending."
msgstr ""
"隧道会随这次分配一起消失。要扛住网络抖动，可以把同一条命令放进 `autossh`、systemd 用户单元或 shell "
"重试循环里——但作业一结束，这些手段都保不住它。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:175
msgid ""
"Verify **from the gateway host**, which is where the gateway will resolve"
" it:"
msgstr "要**在网关主机上**验证，因为网关正是在那里解析它的："

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:181
msgid "5. Register the route"
msgstr "5\\. 注册路由"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:183
msgid ""
"The gateway now sees an ordinary OpenAI-compatible server at "
"`http://127.0.0.1:8001/v1`. Registering it is not special — [Adding a New"
" Local Model](add-local-model.md) is the authority on the registry entry,"
" the `openai_compat` route fields, and verifying the model through the "
"public `/v1` API. Use the fixed tunnel port as `base_url` and your "
"`--served-model-name` as `provider_model_id`."
msgstr ""
"现在，网关看到的就是 `http://127.0.0.1:8001/v1` 上一个普通的 OpenAI "
"兼容服务器，注册它没有任何特别之处。注册表条目怎么写、`openai_compat` 路由有哪些字段、如何通过公开的 `/v1` API "
"验证模型，都以[添加新的本地模型](add-local-model.md)为准。`base_url` "
"填固定的隧道端口，`provider_model_id` 填你的 `--served-model-name`。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:190
msgid "6. Release everything when you are done"
msgstr "6\\. 用完后释放所有资源"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:192
msgid ""
"Skipping this leaves a job burning its walltime, a dead route in the "
"registry, and a stale listener on the gateway host that will make the "
"next allocation's tunnel fail."
msgstr ""
"跳过这一步会留下三个问题：作业还在白白消耗 "
"walltime，注册表里多了一条失效的路由，网关主机上还残留着一个监听，会导致下一次分配的隧道建立失败。"

#: ../developer/hpc-model-host.md:209
msgid ""
"Then confirm from the gateway host that the port is genuinely free — the "
"following should now fail to connect:"
msgstr "然后从网关主机确认端口确实空了出来——下面这条现在应该连不上："
